{"id":"8017023cccfa203a","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-zfc-pcf2-localization-family.md","title":"ZFC Pcf2 Localization Family","display":"df-zfc-pcf2-localization-family — ZFC Pcf2 Localization Family","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-pcf2-localization-family","aliases":["58-df-zfc-pcf2-localization-family"],"display":"df-zfc-pcf2-localization-family — ZFC Pcf2 Localization Family","depends_on":["[[58-df-zfc-pcf2-progressive-set]]","[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[58-df-cardinality]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-pcf2-localization-family"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-pcf2-localization-family</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-pcf2-localization-family — ZFC Pcf2 Localization Family"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"434af3b8c053a816\" href=\"?note=434af3b8c053a816\" title=\"58-df-zfc-pcf2-progressive-set\">58-df-zfc-pcf2-progressive-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"58-df-cardinality\">58-df-cardinality</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,\\mathcal L,\\theta\\in V\">\\(A,\\mathcal L,\\theta\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a>) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2ProgressiveSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2ProgressiveSet}_S\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"434af3b8c053a816\" href=\"?note=434af3b8c053a816\" title=\"58-df-zfc-pcf2-progressive-set\">58-df-zfc-pcf2-progressive-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2LocalizationFamily}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2LocalizationFamily}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf2\\text{-}localization\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPcf2LocalizationFamily}_S(A,\\mathcal L,\\theta)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcPcf2ProgressiveSet}_S(A)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\theta)\\land\\mathcal L\\subseteq[A]^{&lt;\\min(A)}\\land|\\mathcal L|\\leq\\theta\\land\\forall X\\in[A]^{&lt;\\min(A)}\\;\\exists L\\in\\mathcal L\\;(X\\subseteq L)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf2\\text{-}localization\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPcf2LocalizationFamily}_S(A,\\mathcal L,\\theta)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcPcf2ProgressiveSet}_S(A)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\theta)\\land\\mathcal L\\subseteq[A]^{&lt;\\min(A)}\\land|\\mathcal L|\\leq\\theta\\land\\forall X\\in[A]^{&lt;\\min(A)}\\;\\exists L\\in\\mathcal L\\;(X\\subseteq L)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The localizing sets themselves are small. Allowing arbitrary subsets of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> would make the definition collapse, since the singleton family <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{A\\}\">\\(\\{A\\}\\)</span> would localize every small subset.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-zfc-pcf2-progressive-set","status":"resolved","id":"434af3b8c053a816","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-pcf2-progressive-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinality","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinality]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ (see [[58-df-cardinal]]) and $\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2ProgressiveSet}_S$ (see [[58-df-zfc-pcf2-progressive-set]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-pcf2-progressive-set","status":"resolved","id":"434af3b8c053a816","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ (see [[58-df-cardinal]]) and $\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2ProgressiveSet}_S$ (see [[58-df-zfc-pcf2-progressive-set]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,\\mathcal L,\\theta\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2ProgressiveSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2LocalizationFamily}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf2\\text{-}localization\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPcf2LocalizationFamily}_S(A,\\mathcal L,\\theta)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcPcf2ProgressiveSet}_S(A)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\theta)\\land\\mathcal L\\subseteq[A]^{<\\min(A)}\\land|\\mathcal L|\\leq\\theta\\land\\forall X\\in[A]^{<\\min(A)}\\;\\exists L\\in\\mathcal L\\;(X\\subseteq L)","display"